==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s (400%) spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**15 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.

==Strategy==
While [[Self-Playing Organ]] is incredibly fast, this stage has a much better Holy Water to Energy ratio, so farming this stage is best for getting lots of Holy Water quickly. Because both bosses have pretty high stats, you'll need to either rush down the base or just kill both bosses with lots of meatshields and Bahamut.

==='''Strategy 1 (No Ubers, 60s)'''===
