This is pretty simple to execute. Jelly Dumpling and Courier are able to tear through the peons, and with three meatshields (Manic Mohawk, Manic Eraser, and Manic Lion), Bahamut will always be able to get hits on either the peons or the bosses and deliver insanely high damage. Alongside your other rusher support, the bosses should die fairly quickly and you should have a decently fast clear.

==='''Strategy 2 (Uber Combos, 35s)'''===
{{Lineup
