This strategy relies on using Iron Wall and Green Shell to wall all the enemies, while Bahamut and warped Bullet Trains nuke the base. Immediately send out Slime, then at 1600¢, send out Green Shell. When done correctly, Slime will trade with Aku Doge and die, while Green Shell will hit a peon and sit near the base. When you hit 4500¢, send out Bahamut as fast as possible. Bahamut will hit an Aku Doge and kill it. Once this happens, prefire the Iron Wall and send Bullet Train. Bahamut will then hit the base, nuke all the peons, and Green Shell will reattack while the enemies just hit the Iron Wall. From here, Bahamut now has free reign to nuke the base, while your Bullet Train from earlier will hit the base, get warped by Gorilliam, and then hit the base again, resulting in a quick clear.

This lineup has a free slot in it. Because the base dies so fast, there really isn't much point adding anything besides extremely quick Uber rushers like [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]] or [[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|Blanka]]. If you do have them, just deploy them when the boss shockwave plays for some more free damage.

